          "content": {
            "text": "1 集合",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b5",
          "kind": "figure",
          "zone": "aside_left",
          "role": "figure",
          "bbox": [
            110.0,
            300.0,
            260.0,
            410.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": "康托(G. Cantor, 1845—1918), 德国数学家, 集合论创始人.",
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": "corpus/imports/9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133/assets/35b/figures/p0009_p9_b5.jpg",
            "asset_url": "/api/v1/studio/proxy/import/asset?key=corpus%2Fimports%2F9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133%2Fassets%2F35b%2Ffigures%2Fp0009_p9_b5.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b6",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            300.0,
            910.0,
            455.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "我们经常需要把满足一定要求或具有一定特征的对象放在一起或归为一类. 例如:\n(1) 申辉中学高一(1)班的全体学生;\n(2) 所有不大于 100 的自然数;\n(3) 直线 l 上的所有点;\n(4) 不等式 2x+1≤0 的所有解;\n(5) 太阳系的所有行星.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b7",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            455.0,
            910.0,
            495.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "概括地说, 把一些确定的对象的全体叫做集合(set), 简称集. 集合通常用大写字母 A、B、C……表示.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b8",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            495.0,
            910.0,
            540.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "集合所含的各个对象叫做该集合的元素(element). 元素通常用小写字母 a、b、c……表示.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b9",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            540.0,
            910.0,
            605.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "如果 a 是集合 A 的元素, 就记作 a∈A, 读作“a 属于 A”; 如果 a 不是集合 A 的元素, 就记作 a∉A, 读作“a 不属于 A”. 例如, 若 A 是由数 1、3、5、7、9 组成的集合, 则 1∈A, 2∉A.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b10",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            605.0,
            910.0,
            695.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "集合的元素是确定的. 也就是说, 给定一个集合, 一个对象在不在这个集合中就确定了. 例如, “我国的直辖市”组成一个集合, 北京、上海、天津、重庆在这个集合中, 而杭州、南京、深圳等城市不在这个集合中.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b11",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            695.0,
            910.0,
            760.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "一些不确定的对象不能组成一个集合. 例如, “我们班里高个子的同学”不能组成一个集合. 因为“高个子”的标准不够明确、具体, 所以“我们班里高个子的同学”是不确定的.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b12",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            760.0,
            910.0,
            805.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "一个给定集合中的各个元素是互不相同的, 即一个元素在同一个集合中是不能重复出现的.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b13",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            805.0,
            910.0,
            850.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "如果两个集合 A 与 B 的组成元素完全相同, 就称这两个集合相等, 记作 A=B.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b14",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            850.0,
            850.0,
            875.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "元素个数有限的集合称为有限集, 否则就称为无限集.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p9_b15",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "example",
          "bbox": [
            330.0,
            875.0,
            910.0,
            925.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "例 1 判断下列集合是有限集还是无限集, 并说明理由:\n(1) 6 的正整数倍的全体组成的集合;",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        }
      ]
    },
