          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "1.1 集合初步",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b2",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "example",
          "bbox": [
            145.0,
            100.0,
            665.0,
            215.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "例4 选择适当的方法表示下列集合：\n(1) 大于0且小于10的全体偶数组成的集合A；\n(2) 被3除余2的所有自然数组成的集合B；\n(3) 直角坐标平面上由第二象限与第四象限中的所有点组成的集合C.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b3",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            220.0,
            665.0,
            370.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "解 (1) 用列举法：A={2,4,6,8}.\n(2) 用描述法：B={n|n=3k+2, k∈N}.\n(3) 因为第二象限中所有点(x,y)具有的特征是x<0且y>0，而第四象限中所有点具有的特征是x>0且y<0，所以第二象限与第四象限中所有点具有的特征可统一地写为xy<0，于是可用描述法表示该集合：\nC={(x,y)|xy<0}.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b4",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            380.0,
            665.0,
            535.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "数学中，常常需要表示满足一些不等式的全体实数所组成的集合. 为了方便起见，我们引入区间(interval)的概念.\n当a、b∈R且a<b时，规定：\n满足不等式a≤x≤b的全体实数x组成的集合称为一个闭区间，记作[a,b].\n满足不等式a<x<b的全体实数x组成的集合称为一个开区间，记作(a,b).",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b5",
          "kind": "figure",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "figure",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            540.0,
            585.0,
            645.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": "图1-1-1",
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": "corpus/imports/9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133/assets/35b/figures/p0012_p12_b5.jpg",
            "asset_url": "/api/v1/studio/proxy/import/asset?key=corpus%2Fimports%2F9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133%2Fassets%2F35b%2Ffigures%2Fp0012_p12_b5.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b6",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            655.0,
            665.0,
            700.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "满足不等式a≤x<b或a<x≤b的全体实数x所组成的集合称为一个半开半闭区间，分别记作[a,b)或(a,b].",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b7",
          "kind": "figure",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "figure",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            705.0,
            585.0,
            805.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": "图1-1-2",
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": "corpus/imports/9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133/assets/35b/figures/p0012_p12_b7.jpg",
            "asset_url": "/api/v1/studio/proxy/import/asset?key=corpus%2Fimports%2F9ff8ac15d460470ca0c3dd98ddc75133%2Fassets%2F35b%2Ffigures%2Fp0012_p12_b7.jpg"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b8",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            815.0,
            495.0,
            835.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "这里的实数a、b统称为这些区间的端点.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b9",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            835.0,
            665.0,
            925.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "此外，满足不等式x≥a，x>a，x≤b或x<b的全体实数x所组成的集合可分别用区间表示为[a,+∞)，(a,+∞)，(-∞,b]或(-∞,b).\n实数集R可用区间表示为(-∞,+∞).",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p12_b10",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "aside_right",
          "role": "symbol_note",
          "bbox": [
            700.0,
