          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": "A = \\{(x, y) | 2x + y = 5\\}, B = \\{(x, y) | 3x + 2y = 8\\}.",
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b7",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            455.0,
            175.0,
            472.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "求 A ∩ B.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b8",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            480.0,
            665.0,
            512.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "解 由题意，(x, y) ∈ A ∩ B 表示 (x, y) 既属于 A 又属于 B，即 (x, y) 是方程组",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b9",
          "kind": "equation",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            320.0,
            520.0,
            430.0,
            565.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": "\\begin{cases} 2x + y = 5, \\\\ 3x + 2y = 8 \\end{cases}",
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b10",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            570.0,
            535.0,
            590.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "的解，所以 x = 2, y = 1. 于是，A ∩ B = {(2, 1)}.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b11",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            600.0,
            665.0,
            638.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "其次，我们可以把两个已知集合的所有元素放在一起组成一个新的集合.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b12",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            135.0,
            645.0,
            665.0,
            705.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "定义 由所有属于集合 A 或属于集合 B 的元素所组成的集合，叫做集合 A 与 B 的并集 (union)，记作 A ∪ B (读作“A 并 B”)，即",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b13",
          "kind": "equation",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            250.0,
            715.0,
            505.0,
            735.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": null,
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": "A \\cup B = \\{x | x \\in A \\text{ 或 } x \\in B\\}.",
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b14",
          "kind": "text",
          "zone": "main",
          "role": "body",
          "bbox": [
            95.0,
            735.0,
            665.0,
            775.0
          ],
          "anchor_id": null,
          "figure_group_id": null,
          "content": {
            "text": "可以用文氏图直观地反映 A ∪ B 的几种不同情况，如图 1-1-5 所示，其中阴影部分表示 A ∪ B.",
            "caption": null,
            "table_html": null,
            "latex": null,
            "asset_key": null,
            "asset_url": null
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "p16_b15",
          "kind": "figure",
